    FACTUAL CUTOFF: 11 AUGUST 2026

    A regional escalation has interrupted radar coverage along the Jizan coastal corridor while mobile launch systems threaten civilian navigation and port logistics.

    Your forward construction yard and refinery are online. Expand production, capture Radar Node Seven with your engineer, establish layered air defense, locate both mobile launchers, and escort the relief convoy into the port perimeter.

    The background is source-dated. Forces, timing, positions, and outcomes are fictional gameplay abstractions.

